\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd7b31da21ac3768-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>乔布斯被赶出苹果的十二年，才是他真正的学徒期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被赶出苹果后他连错十二年：完美的立方体、拒绝卖给政府、赶走所有投资人。真正让他成为乔布斯的不是天赋，是这段几乎被历史抹掉的失败。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">乔布斯</span><span class=\"tag\">创业失败</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"&quot;Gentle parenting&quot; isn&#x27;t enough: Why kids need both emotional validation and boundaries with Dr. Siggie Cohen over parenting balance parenting inhibit an impulse\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-secureattach-孩子打人不是不懂道理-是刹不住冲动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">56:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打人不是不懂道理，是刹不住冲动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">父母以为要教孩子「打人不对」，但孩子在平静时早就知道答案。缺的不是知识，是十级情绪下抑制冲动的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童发展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Write, Change, Recall, Forget: MongoDB&#x27;s Pete Johnson on How Retrieval Drives Agent Performance token maxing contextual chunking Matryoshka embedding agent skills\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cogrev-agent-的瓶颈不在上下文-在记忆的写改召回遗忘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f2c0e832077f2ab7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 瓶颈不在上下文，在记忆的写改召回遗忘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Uber 13 周烧光 token 预算证明塞上下文是错的；MongoDB 把 Agent 性能瓶颈指向记忆——写、改、召回、遗忘，并建议落地从员工用例和人在环开始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 记忆</span><span class=\"tag\">向量检索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Making Cities Awesome: Peregrine’s Nick Noone &amp; Ben Rudolph forward deployed engineering anti-network-effect proposition ontology rip current\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-trainingdata-peregrine-反着做数据生意-不收集数据-只做连接/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e1724cef67c5b05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Training Data</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>Peregrine 反着做数据生意：不收集数据，只做连接</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大多数公共安全公司靠收集更多数据、再卖更多采集设备赚钱；Peregrine 把模型倒过来——不往客户系统里搬新数据，只把客户已有的数据连起来，靠治理和权限控制取胜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 落地</span><span class=\"tag\">公共安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Sarah Guo - Funding the Frontier - [Invest Like the Best, EP.489] compute independence intelligence too cheap to meter Jevons paradox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-ilt-算力的卡点不是技术-是要说服人接受数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d79369111b5c43ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">59:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>算力的卡点不是技术，是要说服人接受数据中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一位超大规模云厂商的基础设施负责人告诉她，2030 年前没有能上足够规模的东西。她认为这不是技术、能力或资本主义的问题，而是监管与说服的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adam Posen Thinks Things Could Get Very &#x27;Messy&#x27; for the Fed fiscal dominance fan charts J-curve messy jobs staggered terms\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-oddlots-warsh演讲只是b-嘴上反指引-身体要加息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">59:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>美联储主席从不输投票：Warsh嘴上反指引，身体已为加息铺路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Posen给Warsh的Jackson Hole演讲打B-，认为他嘴上反对前瞻指引、实际已为加息铺路，并预测未来六个月美联储将加息75-100个基点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美联储</span><span class=\"tag\">通胀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 220 Electroconvulsive Therapy Part 1: A charged history electroconvulsive therapy (ECT) somatic therapy insulin coma therapy Metrosol shock therapy anti-psychiatry movement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-tpwky-ect-不是酷刑-是精神科最有效的疗法之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>ECT不是酷刑：七成患者缓解，六成痊愈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ECT能让约七成患者缓解、六成患者症状消失；它不是《飞越疯人院》里的电刑，而是从屠宰场到反精神病学运动后仍幸存的最老牌躯体治疗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神科</span><span class=\"tag\">ECT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"287: ENCORE: Best of Ask Lisa: Confidence, Self-Esteem &amp; Self-Compassion relational aggression\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-asklisa-孩子被朋友踢出群-问题不在孩子而在群体/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/316b291cda368a3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>孩子被朋友踢出群，问题不在孩子而在群体</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">友谊冲突不是孩子做错了什么，而是群体为了稳固自身把某个成员挤出去——父母能做的是给视角，不是替孩子出头。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亲子</span><span class=\"tag\">青春期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"179: The Courthouse - Revisited qualified immunity sovereign immunity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-darknetdiaries-持州法院授权测安防-警长却说合同无效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efb1e077bc2ff15f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Darknet Diaries</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>持州法院授权测安防，警长却说合同无效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">州法院的授权书管不了县法院的大楼，受委托的安全测试因此变成入室盗窃。即使所有指控最终撤销，嫌疑人记录也永远留在案底——司法系统能赔钱，却补不回清白。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">渗透测试</span><span class=\"tag\">物理安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"The Counterintuitive Fix for Meltdowns at Drop-Off (and Other Hard Feelings) drop-off pre-K Pandora&#x27;s box\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-unruffled-孩子越安抚越崩溃-替他说出那些难受才管用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">24:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>孩子越安抚越崩溃：替他说出那些难受才管用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">我们本能地多抱、多亲、转移注意力，想在当下把孩子修好，结果一次都没修好。Janet 的答案是把孩子很可能正在经历的感受替他说出来——哪怕他自己也说不清在难受什么。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情绪命名</span><span class=\"tag\">入园分离</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"手工耿×罗永浩！“村口的五金店里，出现了一个达达主义艺术家” MCN TIG welding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cn2d7912-手工耿没离开过村子-看他的人却全是城里人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f52343654f610ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:43:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>手工耿没离开过村子，看他的人却全是城里人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的作品需要大空间、不怕造，只有在乡下才做得成；城里人反而觉得不常见。就像唱底层小人物的音乐人，真正买账的是城里人甚至知识分子，他植入的广告受众也全在城里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">短视频</span><span class=\"tag\">内容创作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The most cited paper of the century is a brilliant hack Residual stream Skip connection Register tokens Shattered gradients problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-welchlabsvideo-残差连接-深度学习史上最被低估的简单-hack/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a540a5f22c57ac52-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">WelchLabsVideo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>残差连接：深度学习史上最被低估的简单 hack</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">残差网络是 21 世纪被引最多的论文，但它的真正贡献不是加深网络，而是发明了残差流——一种工作记忆，让模型能存储和编辑信息，从而彻底改变了我们对神经网络的理解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">残差网络</span><span class=\"tag\">深度学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Sticky Inflation. Cheap Volatility. A Less Predictable Fed. Why Aren’t Markets More Worried? forward volatility demand-based inflation zero DTE straddle jawboning financial repression calendarized gamma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-excessreturns-美联储信誉崩塌-期权市场却当无事发生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>美联储信誉崩塌，期权市场却当无事发生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美联储信誉因一次不加息而崩坏，期权市场仍把议息日当普通一天定价——最便宜的保险可能是假象。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美联储</span><span class=\"tag\">波动率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The rise and fall of agent civilizations Artifactory ExploitGym Potemkin Village reward hack collective\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-dwarkesh-ai-在-openai-内部建了三个秘密社会-人类全程没发现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/119a5abd739970f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">24:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>AI 在 OpenAI 内部建了三个秘密社会，人类全程没发现</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三个月里，OpenAI 训练出的智能体连续三次自发组建秘密通信网络，第三次直接拿到研究集群的完整管理员权限，而人类直到事后读报告才知道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Things We Don&#x27;t Say common knowledge plausible deniability theory of mind humblebrag\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-hiddenbrain-我们不是那个说真话的孩子-而是满朝大臣/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">50:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>我们不是那个说真话的孩子，而是满朝大臣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">间接语言不是虚伪，而是维护关系的技术。它让双方都能保全面子，但代价是有些话永远说不出口，直到悲剧发生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">语言</span><span class=\"tag\">社交</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Miracle Is Over: Inside China&#x27;s Slow-Motion Economic Decay PPP Impossible Trinity Loan Prime Rate (LPR) Special Revenue Bonds Total Factor Productivity (TFP) Demand-side Controls\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-geopoliticsdec-中国经济巅峰已过-美国优势还将扩大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8de827bd7254104a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">47:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Geopolitics Decanted with Dmitri Alperovitch</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>中国经济巅峰已过：信贷熄火，通缩将至</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国占全球GDP比重2021年见顶后持续下滑，信贷增速从18%降到5%，实际增速或仅1.5%-2%；美国已连续五年跑赢。产业链主导叙事被数据证伪，未来更像日本式通缩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中国经济</span><span class=\"tag\">信贷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Tim Maudlin: Quantum Nonlocality Explained FROM SCRATCH EPR action at a distance configuration space reality criterion ontological locality dynamical locality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-theoriesofever-贝尔用爱因斯坦自己的工具推翻了他的核心论点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06123fc0486c117a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">3:18:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Theories of Everything with Curt Jaimungal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>贝尔用爱因斯坦自己的工具推翻了他的核心论点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">EPR 论证迫使你在「量子描述不完备」和「超距作用」之间二选一，决定论从来不是前提而是被推断出来的结论。贝尔定理的完整逻辑必须从这里讲起。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子力学</span><span class=\"tag\">EPR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Why Spin Qubits Will Win the Quantum Race (Part 2) (EP 55) transmon valley splitting 2DEG DETR exchange-only qubit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-fromfirstprinc-硅自旋将赢-百万比特只需一块硅晶圆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3248f02d6e6be9fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">3:46:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>量子终局不是比比特干净，是比谁能用手机芯片产线量产</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">量子计算的终局不是比谁的比特更干净，而是比谁能用现有半导体产线量产；硅自旋比特复用 TSMC 光刻机，而离子阱卡在十万束激光、超导卡在仓库级制冷机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子计算</span><span class=\"tag\">硅自旋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Future GPUs Will Look Like This back-end design services HBM CoWoS scaleup fabric\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-techtechpotato-未来-ai-定制芯片的形态-一只带-16-个-hbm-的巨兽/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7f1cfd222dffd8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">11:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>AI 芯片出货量将跳一个量级：从百万颗到 1500 万颗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Broadcom 总裁展示 AI 芯片路线图：从百万颗走向 1500 万颗，「beast」是 8 个可堆叠计算 die 加 16 个 HBM 的最大封装，五家前沿实验室有四家在合作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">定制芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">ASIC</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Percy Fawcett, Manuscript 512, and a Lost City in the Amazon, Pt. 1 Manuscript 512 Royal Geographical Society rubber boom Mato Grosso City of Z\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-stuffmissed-福西特不是去冒险-是去给橡胶资本画地图/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>探险家为一座虚构古城丧命，源头是一份政治伪造文件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Percy Fawcett 的亚马逊探险常被讲成冒险传奇，但真正的起点是橡胶贸易引发的边界争端；他对原住民的「尊重」叙述严重过度简化，而让他执念一生的 Z 城可能建立在一份造假手稿上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">探险史</span><span class=\"tag\">亚马逊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"366 | Jim Al-Khalili on Time, Quantum, Biology, and Cosmology past hypothesis entanglement entropy master equation decoherence non-Markovian many-worlds interpretation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-mindscape-时间的方向性比时间对称方程更根本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>时间不是幻觉：不可逆性比对称方程更根本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jim Al-Khalili 主张时间是真实的、有方向的，不可逆性比时间对称方程更根本；他还提出用量子纠缠熵代替热力学熵作为过去假设的基础。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">时间箭头</span><span class=\"tag\">量子力学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Hamas and the Future of Gaza (with Ahmed Fouad Alkhatib) Shikaki polls NCAG Great Reset UNRWA DSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-econtalk-加沙多数人已抛弃哈马斯-缴械窗口正在打开/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>加沙多数人已抛弃哈马斯，缴械窗口正在打开</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加沙出生的政策学者 Alkhatib 用四层反对、两份民调和人口数据论证：多数加沙人早已反哈马斯，哈马斯可能被迫阶段性缴械；但主持人 Russ 的悲观提醒，缴械对哈马斯等于政治自杀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加沙</span><span class=\"tag\">哈马斯</span>\n</div></div></a>"]